    "text": "3 hours ago Like this article? Support us by subscribing here. Your donation will help us continue to provide quality-of-life news and make local impact possible. Pregnancy transforms nearly every part of daily life for women, from nutrition and exercise to the products they use on their bodies and around the house. Skincare is no exception. Pregnancy-related hormone changes can cause breakouts, increased sensitivity, or dark spots, and now, that go-to cream or serum may no longer be the safest solution. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
